('Afritech covers all ten African nations at the FIFA U-17 World Cup Qatar 2026: groups, players to watch, match centre and briefings for clubs, agents and federations.', 'Afritech couvre les dix nations africaines de la Coupe du monde U-17 de la FIFA, Qatar 2026 : groupes, joueurs à suivre, centre des matchs et briefings pour les clubs, agents et fédérations.', 'Afritech inafuatilia mataifa yote kumi ya Afrika kwenye Kombe la Dunia la FIFA U-17, Qatar 2026: makundi, wachezaji wa kufuatilia, kituo cha mechi na mazungumzo kwa vilabu, mawakala na mashirikisho.', 'A Afritech acompanha as dez seleções africanas na Copa do Mundo Sub-17 da FIFA, Catar 2026: grupos, jogadores para acompanhar, central de jogos e briefings para clubes, agentes e federações.'),
("Afritech covers the tournaments where Africa's next players are found: every African squad, every match and a clear recommendation on the players who matter. Tap a tournament for groups, players to watch and the match centre.", 'Afritech couvre les tournois où se révèlent les prochains joueurs africains : chaque sélection africaine, chaque match et une recommandation claire sur les joueurs qui comptent. Touchez un tournoi pour les groupes, les joueurs à suivre et le centre des matchs.', 'Afritech inafuatilia mashindano ambapo wachezaji wajao wa Afrika hupatikana: kila kikosi cha Afrika, kila mechi na pendekezo la wazi kuhusu wachezaji muhimu. Gusa mashindano kuona makundi, wachezaji wa kufuatilia na kituo cha mechi.', 'A Afritech acompanha os torneios onde surgem os próximos jogadores da África: cada seleção africana, cada partida e uma recomendação clara sobre os jogadores que importam. Toque em um torneio para ver grupos, jogadores para acompanhar e a central de jogos.'),
('Afritech on LinkedIn', 'Afritech sur LinkedIn', 'Afritech kwenye LinkedIn', 'Afritech no LinkedIn'),
("Afritech's assessment models and scoring methods are proprietary and stay in-house. Clients receive the conclusions, the evidence behind them and the plan that follows.", "Les modèles d'évaluation et les méthodes de notation d'Afritech sont propriétaires et restent en interne. Les clients reçoivent les conclusions, les éléments qui les fondent et le plan qui suit.", 'Mifumo ya tathmini na njia za kutoa alama za Afritech ni mali yetu na hubaki ndani ya kampuni. Wateja hupokea hitimisho, ushahidi wake na mpango unaofuata.', 'Os modelos de avaliação e os métodos de pontuação da Afritech são proprietários e ficam internos. Os clientes recebem as conclusões, as evidências por trás delas e o plano seguinte.'),
