('Domestic and diaspora players tracked together', 'Joueurs locaux et de la diaspora suivis ensemble', 'Wachezaji wa ndani na wa diaspora wanafuatiliwa pamoja', 'Jogadores locais e da diáspora acompanhados juntos'),
