('Live tournament scouting coverage of African talent, for clubs, agents and federations.', 'Scouting en direct des talents africains, pour les clubs, agents et fédérations.', 'Uskauti wa moja kwa moja wa vipaji vya Afrika, kwa vilabu, mawakala na mashirikisho.', 'Scouting ao vivo de talentos africanos, para clubes, agentes e federações.'),
